<h2>System model</h2>
<p>REFALL AB connects a manager, specialist agents, and persistent workbench state.
The manager determines the next work item from subject context, scope, coverage, and unresolved obligations.
Specialists return structured observations and evidence.
The workbench stores the results and controls finding transitions.</p>
